    "讀取 metadata 也會連接 P2P 網路，首次須同意可能上傳。上限為 1–10485760 bytes/s；設定頁可調整活動傳輸上限或停止全部 P2P。快取清理不移除 Torrent 暫存與完成檔。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Loading metadata also connects to the P2P network and requires initial consent to possible uploads. The limit is 1–10485760 bytes/s. In Settings, adjust active transfer limits or stop all P2P. Clearing caches does not remove torrent temporary or completed files."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "读取元数据也会连接 P2P 网络，首次须同意可能上传。上限为 1–10485760 bytes/s；设置页可调整活动传输上限或停止全部 P2P。清理缓存不移除 Torrent 临时文件与已下载文件。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "讀取 metadata 也會連接 P2P 網路，首次須同意可能上傳。上限為 1–10485760 bytes/s；設定頁可調整活動傳輸上限或停止全部 P2P。快取清理不移除 Torrent 暫存與完成檔。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
